  "goodToKnow": "Die Augenbraue is the eyebrow: die Augenbrauen hochziehen (to raise one's eyebrows, in surprise or scepticism), die Augenbrauen zupfen (to pluck). Other eye words: die Wimper (eyelash), ohne mit der Wimper zu zucken (without batting an eyelid), das Augenlid (eyelid) and die Pupille. The short form die Braue is also used. Plural: die Augenbrauen."
